{"ID":"20240118151159-qz3z7tc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151159-qz3z7tc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151159-qz3z7tc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151159-vdok8uw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122122332-9y1he6a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122122327-ayfda0u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:62,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:62\u0026#125;","title":"154理石155长石156肤青","type":"doc","updated":"20240131103131"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151159-vdok8uw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151159-vdok8uw","updated":"20240122122303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"理石"}]},{"ID":"20240122122304-p7ncnix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122304-p7ncnix","updated":"20240122122308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛寒，主身热利胃，解烦益精，明目，破积聚，去三虫。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122308-kdjjk9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122308-kdjjk9c","updated":"20240122122311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"长石"}]},{"ID":"20240122122313-4lvqvx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122313-4lvqvx6","updated":"20240122122317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛寒，主身热，四肢寒厥，利小便，通血脉明目去翳眇，下三虫，杀蛊毒久服不饥。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122318-bqdupr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122318-bqdupr1","updated":"20240122122321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肤青"}]},{"ID":"20240122122321-n8hqhb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122321-n8hqhb0","updated":"20240122122325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛平，主虫毒及蛇，菜肉诸毒，恶创。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122326-efjud3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122326-efjud3b"}},{"ID":"20240122122327-ayfda0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122327-ayfda0u","updated":"20240131103131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"154、155、156，这三味药呢，理石，长石，肤青，我们使用的也不是很多。诸位看一看，像那个理石说，破积聚啊，去三虫，我们药非常多，可以去这种的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122122332-9y1he6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122332-9y1he6a"}}]}